snippet.description:
Folk Hero receives a major visual update!

Publisher Targem Games and developer Chudo-Yudo Games present Visual Remaster — a major update that refreshes the game's visuals and introduces a range of technical improvements.

The remaster includes:
• reworked color grading;
• unique color filters for individual scenes;
• improved key locations, including the starting Beach area;
• updated points of interest, UI, visual effects, and sprites;
• additional optimization and bug fixes.

Alongside the update, Folk Hero is now available on PlayStation 4 and PlayStation 5, with full gamepad support.

Visual Remaster is now available on Steam and Nintendo Switch. The PlayStation version is available on the PlayStation Store.

Thank you for supporting Folk Hero!

Try the updated version and set out on a new journey across Buyan Island.

